      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "私の名前はダーウェイで、学生です。",
      "text_en": "My name is Dawei and I am a student.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"わたし\" data-defn=\"I/me\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">私</span><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なまえ\" data-defn=\"name; given name/first name\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">名前</span><rt>なまえ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"だーうぇい\" data-defn=\"David (name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ダーウェイ</span><rt>だーうぇい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"で\" data-defn=\"location / means marker (at/in/by)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">で</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"がくせい\" data-defn=\"student (esp. a university student)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">学生</span><rt>がくせい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"です\" data-defn=\"be / is / are (polite copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">です</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "reading": "わたし の なまえ は だーうぇい で、がくせい です。",
      "romaji": "watashi no namae wa daawei de, gakusei desu.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.67,
      "duration": 3.67
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "今、中国で中国語を勉強しています。",
      "text_en": "Now I am studying Chinese in China.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いま\" data-defn=\"now / at present\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">今</span><rt>いま</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ちゅうごく\" data-defn=\"China; Chūgoku region of western Honshu (incl. Okayama, Hiroshima, Shimane, Tottori a\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">中国</span><rt>ちゅうごく</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"で\" data-defn=\"location / means marker (at/in/by)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">で</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ちゅうごくご\" data-defn=\"Chinese (language)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">中国語</span><rt>ちゅうごくご</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"を\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"べんきょう\" data-defn=\"study; diligence\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">勉強</span><rt>べんきょう</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"し\" data-defn=\"to do (stem of する)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">し</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"て\" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"い\" data-defn=\"to be / to exist (auxiliary verb)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">い</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ます\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (present/future)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ます</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "reading": "いま、ちゅうごく で ちゅうごくご を べんきょう して います。",
      "romaji": "ima, chuugoku de chuugokugo o benkyou shite imasu.",
      "start": 4.02,
      "end": 8.0,
      "duration": 3.98
    },
